---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms and conditions governing your use of kneed.tv and all related services.">
  <main class="wf-container py-page" style="max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="wf-page-head">
      <div class="wf-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="wf-page-h1">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="wf-page-intro">Last updated June 2025. These terms apply to kneed.tv and all related services.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="simple-body">

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using kneed.tv ("the Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Site.</p>
        <p>The Site is operated by Comma Films Pty Ltd, based in Melbourne, Victoria, Australia. In these terms, "we", "us" and "our" refers to Comma Films Pty Ltd, and "(K)Need" refers to the digital journal and its associated services.</p>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">User Accounts</h2>
        <p>To access certain features — including saving bakeries, leaving ratings, and posting comments — you must create an account. You are responsible for:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;">
          <li>Providing accurate and complete information when creating your account</li>
          <li>Keeping your account credentials secure and confidential</li>
          <li>All activity that occurs under your account</li>
          <li>Notifying us promptly at <a href="mailto:hello@kneed.com.au" style="color:var(--amber);">hello@kneed.com.au</a> if you suspect unauthorised access to your account</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You must be at least 13 years of age to create an account. By creating an account, you confirm that you meet this requirement.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Community Rules</h2>
        <p>When using the Site — including posting comments, leaving ratings, and submitting bakeries — you agree not to:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;">
          <li>Post content that is false, misleading or inaccurate, including incorrect information about bakeries</li>
          <li>Harass, abuse, threaten, or intimidate other users or bakery staff</li>
          <li>Post spam, unsolicited promotional material, or repetitive content</li>
          <li>Impersonate any person, business or entity</li>
          <li>Post content that is defamatory, offensive, discriminatory, or in violation of any applicable law</li>
          <li>Use the Site for any commercial purpose without our prior written consent</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the Site or its systems</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We reserve the right to remove any content that violates these rules or that we deem inappropriate at our sole discretion, without notice.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">User-Generated Content</h2>
        <p>You retain ownership of any content you contribute to the Site, including comments, ratings, and other submissions ("User Content").</p>
        <p>By submitting User Content, you grant Comma Films Pty Ltd a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to display, reproduce, and distribute that content on the Site and in connection with our services. This licence continues for as long as the content remains on the Site.</p>
        <p>You represent and warrant that:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;">
          <li>You own or have the necessary rights to the content you submit</li>
          <li>Your content does not infringe the intellectual property rights, privacy rights, or other rights of any third party</li>
          <li>Your content is accurate to the best of your knowledge</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not claim ownership of your User Content and we will not sell it to third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All films, photography, written editorial content, design, and branding on (K)Need are owned by Comma Films Pty Ltd unless otherwise stated. This includes all video content, bakery profiles, articles, and the (K)Need name and identity.</p>
        <p>You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, publicly display, or create derivative works from our content without our prior written permission. Sharing links to the Site is encouraged and does not require permission.</p>
        <p>If you believe any content on the Site infringes your intellectual property rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@kneed.com.au" style="color:var(--amber);">hello@kneed.com.au</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Bakery Submissions</h2>
        <p>You may suggest a bakery for inclusion in (K)Need via our submission form. By submitting a bakery, you confirm that the information you provide is accurate to the best of your knowledge.</p>
        <p>Submission of a bakery does not guarantee it will be featured. We review all submissions at our discretion and may use, modify, or decline submitted information without obligation. We may contact you for further details about your submission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Termination</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or permanently remove your account and access to the Site if we determine, in our sole discretion, that you have violated these Terms of Use, engaged in harmful conduct, or otherwise acted in a way that is inconsistent with the spirit of the (K)Need community.</p>
        <p>You may delete your account at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:hello@kneed.com.au" style="color:var(--amber);">hello@kneed.com.au</a>. Upon deletion, your personal data will be handled in accordance with our <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--amber);">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>The Site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</p>
        <p>Information on the Site — including bakery hours, locations, and other details — may not always be current. We recommend confirming details directly with the bakery before visiting.</p>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Comma Films Pty Ltd will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Site or reliance on any content on the Site.</p>
        <p>Nothing in these terms limits any rights you may have under Australian consumer protection law that cannot be excluded by agreement.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">External Links</h2>
        <p>The Site contains links to third-party websites, including bakery websites and social media profiles. These links are provided for convenience only. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or privacy practices of any third-party sites and do not endorse them.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Use are governed by the laws of Victoria, Australia. Any disputes arising under these terms will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Victoria.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:200;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--parchment);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Contact</h2>
        <p>For any questions about these terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@kneed.com.au" style="color:var(--amber);">hello@kneed.com.au</a>.</p>
        <p>Comma Films Pty Ltd<br/>Melbourne, Victoria, Australia</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
